1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,320
Some of the people when they're done with the prayer they raise their hands to ask god.
有些人在祈祷结束后，会举起双手向神祈求。

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:11,829
And these are some of the moments we believe the prayers are times to communicate with god more directly.
这些是一些时刻；我们相信，祈祷是更直接与神交流的时候，

3
00:00:11,839 --> 00:00:18,399
And explain and expresses that you have of sadness of happiness thank him for things.
说出、表达自己的悲伤和喜悦，并为一些事感谢神（原字幕语法有重复）。

4
00:00:18,399 --> 00:00:20,320
That's why we pray five times a day.
这就是我们一天祈祷五次的原因。

5
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,160
We believe god is the most important for us that we have to communicate all the time constantly.
我们相信神对我们最重要，所以必须一直、不断地与神交流。

6
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:35,600
We feel more connected that's why we prepare to pray in the ground because we feel it's we're more even connected to the ground and we feel more spiritual in the nature.
我们感觉更有连接，所以“prepare to pray in the ground”；我们觉得与大地更相连，在自然里更有灵性。

7
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,789
All right the night has come there is a fire behind us.
好，夜幕降临了，我们身后生着火，

8
00:00:38,799 --> 00:00:42,720
And everyone's just hanging out and it's going to be an amazing evening.
大家正闲待着，这将是个很棒的夜晚。

9
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:54,389
It smells so good yeah yeah you started to smell that yeah.
闻起来真香。对，对，你开始闻到了吧？对。

10
00:00:54,399 --> 00:01:03,430
This thing was alive just a couple hours ago probably an hour ago yes.
这东西几个小时前还活着，可能就一小时前。是的。

11
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:07,360
That's cooked really nicely that's really yummy it's really yummy.
做得真好，真的很好吃，很好吃。

12
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:13,270
What part of the shoot is it you know I think it's a kidney.
这是“shoot”的哪个部位？你知道，我想是肾脏。

13
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:17,760
That's a good name really really tasty.
“that's a good name”（字幕如此）。真的很好吃。

14
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:28,870
So fresh I mean literally they just killed the sheep an hour ago put on the fire cooked to perfection.
太新鲜了。我的意思是，他们真的一小时前刚宰了羊，放到火上，烤得恰到好处。

15
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:31,280
How do you feel that saudi is changing so fast.
你怎么看沙特变化这么快这件事？

16
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:37,510
Does it make you sad that the traditions are going to slip away.
传统可能会逐渐消失，这会让你难过吗？

17
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:42,640
He's saying no it actually makes him happy to see that change because it's good.
他说不会，看到这样的改变反而让他开心，因为是好事。

18
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:47,920
He's happy for his kids his grandkids is going to help them with education and all of that.
他替孩子和孙辈开心，这会帮助他们接受教育等。

19
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:53,120
So this change happened really fast and in a very good way.
所以，这变化来得很快，而且往很好的方向发展。

20
00:01:53,120 --> 00:02:00,000
There are certain values that like he would like to keep and of course for the next generation.
也有一些价值观，他希望保留下来，当然也留给下一代。

21
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,750
It's so beautiful out here the food is being prepared in the tent behind me.
这里真美。食物正在我身后的帐篷里准备，

22
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:14,070
And I just want to step outside and take a moment and just say that the stars are beautiful.
我只想走出来，花一点时间说：星空真美。

23
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:26,390
This experience is absolutely amazing these guys have been cooking for like three hours.
这次体验太棒了。这些伙计已经做了大概三个小时的饭。

24
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:33,670
Look at this bowl slash plate so much rice and you got the sheep that's being put on top right now.
看看这个碗，或者说盘子：这么多米饭，现在正在把羊肉放到上面。

25
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:36,630
It's going to feed a lot of people.
这得够很多人吃。

26
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:48,070
This is the biggest plate of sheep I've ever seen in my life.
这是我这辈子见过最大盘的羊肉。

27
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:54,840
The rice is like smothered in the juices of the sheep yeah.
米饭好像都裹满了羊肉的汁水。对。

28
00:02:55,039 --> 00:03:03,110
How's the traditional way salt not much spices very good.
传统做法是什么样？盐，不太放香料。很好。

29
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:15,510
It's time for bed there's no running water here so gotta use bottled water brush my teeth.
该睡觉了。这里没有自来水，所以得用瓶装水刷牙。

30
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:17,670
I haven't showered in three days now.
我现在已经三天没洗澡了。

31
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:22,200
I can start to smell my hair from here which is gross because I have short hair.
我在这儿都能闻到自己的头发，这挺恶心的，因为我的头发还很短。
